    <TEXT>
        <Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_DOKUMENTENSTUBE_PEDIA</Tag>
        <English>"Ah, Grand Master Sigismund, what can this old man do for you?" The old man placed down a book carefully on the table. The knight entered the room and removed his sword. He placed it on the table. "I need all information about the vampires of the Calabim Nation."

The old man nodded and began searching. "Please take a seat, Sigismund. I will require some time. Will there be a war with the vampires?" Sigismund shook his head. "No war. It is of personal interest to me only."
        </English>
    </TEXT>
    <TEXT>
        <Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_DOKUMENTENSTUBE_STRATEGY</Tag>
        <English>While the Dokumentenstube gives less research bonus to the city, it increases instead Scientists in general.Build it to increase the research and culture output of your city.</English>
    </TEXT>
